3 Methods
3.3 Inference
At inference, we follow the training procedure in Section 3.2 (see Figures 1, 2, and 6). We set the hyperparameters top_p = 0 . 95 and top_k = 50 to promote diversity in cell generation. For conditional cell generation and unconditional cell generation used in our experiments from Section 2.2, we randomly sample prompt templates as input, inserting the cell type where needed for conditional generation. For autoregressive cell type prediction, we randomly sample templates as in training but use either real cell sentences from our test dataset or generated cell sentences.
